DESCRIPTION:The BSO kicks off its 57th season with a FREE concert at the Sw
 itchyard Park Main Stage. \n\n6:15pm: Meet the Instruments\nFor kids of all
  ages\, get up close with the instruments of the orchestra! From violins to
  trumpets\, cellos to clarinets\, you will get a hands on experience and le
 arn how each instrument makes it’s musical magic. \n\n7pm: Concert\, Switch
 yard Park Main Stage\nEnjoy familiar classics like Copland’s Rodeo\, Bizet’
 s Carmen Suite\, and more!
